            "value" : "填写发生了什么。预期行为和步骤是可选的，但非常有帮助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill the workspace bar with fully opaque black, overriding the tint, material, and border." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
